    \item \textbf{Actionable guidelines at zero cost.} Do not add auxiliary spatial heads with gradient flow under BN. If required, use detached gradients with LayerNorm. No ground-truth spatial labels are needed; the auxiliary head is discarded at inference (\S\ref{sec:discussion}).

    \item \textbf{Codebase sensitivity as a confound.} A single bug fix in the training codebase shifts absolute CAR by up to 8.6\,pp, exceeding the largest experimental effect (${\leq}5.7$\,pp). Non-hyperparameter implementation details can dominate the signal of interest, a cautionary finding for VLA fine-tuning reproducibility (\S\ref{sec:discussion}, Appendix~\ref{app:codebase}).
\end{enumerate}

